The selected subset records exact compatibility paths, support statements,
browser release metadata, source references, and package provenance needed by
the ControlCurrent security-control catalogue. ControlCurrent does not reproduce
the complete BCD package or MDN article prose.

ControlCurrent also includes a transformed, selected subset of:

Web Platform Features
https://github.com/web-platform-dx/web-features
Copyright W3C WebDX Community Group contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The selected subset records only exact BCD-path associations and Baseline
status metadata used to add adoptability context to mapped controls. It does
not reproduce the complete Web Platform Features package.

The complete Apache License, Version 2.0 terms are distributed in
public/third-party-notices.txt.

